#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "CheckOff"
msgstr "CheckOff"

#. Description of the plugin
#: checkoff.php
msgid "Let visitors build their own multi-level checklists from building blocks — simple lists, weekday lists, colour and number ratings, counters and notes — and tick them off."
msgstr "Besucher stellen sich aus Bausteinen eigene, mehrstufige Checklisten zusammen – einfache Listen, Wochentagslisten, Farb- und Zahlenbewertungen, Zähler und Notizen – und haken sie ab."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:112
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemein"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:113
msgid "Where checklists are shown and who may create them."
msgstr "Wo Checklisten angezeigt werden und wer sie anlegen darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:117
msgid "Checklist page"
msgstr "Checklisten-Seite"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:118
msgid "The page that contains the [cko_app] or [cko_checklist] shortcode. Links to checklists and the \"Open\" form lead there. Without one, they lead to the page the form is on."
msgstr "Die Seite mit dem Shortcode [cko_app] oder [cko_checklist]. Links zu Checklisten und das Formular „Öffnen“ führen dorthin. Ohne Auswahl führen sie zu der Seite, auf der das Formular steht."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:125
msgid "Guests may create checklists"
msgstr "Gäste dürfen Checklisten anlegen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:126
msgid "Off: only logged-in users can create checklists. Opening and ticking existing checklists by their ID is always possible."
msgstr "Aus: Nur angemeldete Benutzer können Checklisten anlegen. Bestehende Checklisten per ID öffnen und abhaken ist immer möglich."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:133
msgid "Offer templates"
msgstr "Vorlagen anbieten"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:134
msgid "Show the templates in the form that creates a checklist. To make a template, build a checklist on the website and mark it as a template on its screen under CheckOff → All Checklists."
msgstr "Zeigt die Vorlagen im Formular zum Anlegen einer Checkliste. Für eine Vorlage baust du eine Checkliste auf der Website und markierst sie unter CheckOff → Alle Checklisten auf ihrer Seite als Vorlage."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:141
msgid "Live update"
msgstr "Live-Abgleich"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:142
msgid "Seconds between two checks for changes made on other devices while a checklist is open. 0 = off (changes appear after reloading)."
msgstr "Sekunden zwischen zwei Abfragen nach Änderungen auf anderen Geräten, solange eine Checkliste offen ist. 0 = aus (Änderungen erscheinen nach dem Neuladen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:151
msgid "Length of new IDs"
msgstr "Länge neuer IDs"

#. translators: 1: minimum, 2: maximum.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:154
#, php-format
msgid "Characters, %1$s to %2$s. Longer IDs are harder to guess and harder to type. Existing IDs keep their length."
msgstr "Zeichen, %1$s bis %2$s. Längere IDs sind schwerer zu erraten und schwerer abzutippen. Bestehende IDs behalten ihre Länge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:168
msgid "Building blocks"
msgstr "Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:169
msgid "Which building blocks visitors can use, and how the ratings look. A block that is switched off is no longer offered; checklists already using it keep working."
msgstr "Welche Bausteine Besucher verwenden können und wie die Bewertungen aussehen. Ein abgeschalteter Baustein wird nicht mehr angeboten; Checklisten, die ihn schon verwenden, funktionieren weiter."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:174
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Grenzen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:175
msgid "Protect the site against oversized checklists and misuse."
msgstr "Schützt die Website vor übergroßen Checklisten und Missbrauch."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:179
msgid "Nesting depth"
msgstr "Verschachtelungstiefe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:180
msgid "How many levels a checklist may have, the top level included."
msgstr "Wie viele Ebenen eine Checkliste haben darf, die oberste mitgezählt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:189
msgid "Maximum size"
msgstr "Maximale Größe"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:190
msgid "How many entries and sub-lists one checklist may contain in total."
msgstr "Wie viele Einträge und Unterlisten eine Checkliste insgesamt enthalten darf."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:199
msgid "New checklists per hour"
msgstr "Neue Checklisten pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:200
msgid "Per visitor. 0 = unlimited."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. 0 = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:209
msgid "Unknown IDs per hour"
msgstr "Unbekannte IDs pro Stunde"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:210
msgid "Per visitor. After this many attempts with IDs that do not exist, opening checklists is blocked for an hour, so IDs cannot be guessed by trying. 0 = unlimited (not recommended)."
msgstr "Pro Besucher. Nach so vielen Versuchen mit IDs, die es nicht gibt, ist das Öffnen von Checklisten für eine Stunde gesperrt – so lassen sich IDs nicht durch Ausprobieren erraten. 0 = unbegrenzt (nicht empfohlen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:221 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:1605
msgid "E-mail"
msgstr "E-Mail"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:222
msgid "Subscriptions by e-mail and the mails CheckOff sends. Subscribers confirm their address first (double opt-in); only the address, the checklist and the time of confirmation are stored."
msgstr "Abos per E-Mail und die E-Mails, die CheckOff verschickt. Abonnenten bestätigen ihre Adresse zuerst (Double-Opt-in); gespeichert werden nur die Adresse, die Checkliste und der Zeitpunkt der Bestätigung."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:227
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Wartung"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:228
msgid "Cleanup and uninstall."
msgstr "Aufräumen und Deinstallation."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:232
msgid "Delete unused checklists"
msgstr "Unbenutzte Checklisten löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:233
msgid "Days without being opened after which a checklist is deleted automatically (checked once a day). 0 = never."
msgstr "Tage ohne Aufruf, nach denen eine Checkliste automatisch gelöscht wird (einmal täglich geprüft). 0 = nie."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:242
msgid "Delete checklists on uninstall"
msgstr "Checklisten bei Deinstallation löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:243
msgid "When the plugin is deleted, also delete all checklists. Settings are always removed."
msgstr "Beim Löschen des Plugins auch alle Checklisten löschen. Die Einstellungen werden immer entfernt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:269 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:344
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:273
msgid "Allow subscriptions"
msgstr "Abos erlauben"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:274
msgid "Visitors can subscribe to a checklist with their e-mail address. Set up the sender and the footer (imprint) below first."
msgstr "Besucher können eine Checkliste mit ihrer E-Mail-Adresse abonnieren. Richte vorher unten Absender und Fußzeile (Impressum) ein."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:281
msgid "Consent text"
msgstr "Einwilligungstext"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:282
msgid "Shown beside the checkbox visitors tick to subscribe. Links are allowed. Empty: a standard sentence with a link to the privacy policy page."
msgstr "Steht neben dem Kästchen, das Besucher zum Abonnieren ankreuzen. Links sind erlaubt. Leer: ein Standardsatz mit Link zur Datenschutzerklärung."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:289
msgid "Subscriptions per checklist"
msgstr "Abos pro Checkliste"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:290
msgid "At most this many addresses can subscribe to one checklist."
msgstr "Höchstens so viele Adressen können eine Checkliste abonnieren."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:299
msgid "Delete unconfirmed after"
msgstr "Unbestätigte löschen nach"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:300
msgid "Hours. A subscription that is not confirmed by then is deleted together with its address."
msgstr "Stunden. Ein bis dahin nicht bestätigtes Abo wird samt Adresse gelöscht."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:310
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Absender"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:314
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Absendername"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:315
msgid "Empty: the site title."
msgstr "Leer: der Titel der Website."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:323
msgid "Sender address"
msgstr "Absenderadresse"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:324
msgid "Empty: the administration e-mail address. Use an address of this domain, or mails may end up as spam."
msgstr "Leer: die Administrator-E-Mail-Adresse. Verwende eine Adresse dieser Domain, sonst landen Mails womöglich im Spam."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:332
msgid "Footer"
msgstr "Fußzeile"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:333
msgid "Under every mail, e.g. the imprint (who sends this mail and how to reach them). Links are allowed. Placeholder in templates: {{ footer_html }}."
msgstr "Unter jeder Mail, z. B. das Impressum (wer die Mail verschickt und wie man ihn erreicht). Links sind erlaubt. Platzhalter in Vorlagen: {{ footer_html }}."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:341
msgid "Mails"
msgstr "Mails"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:342
msgid "Which mails subscribers receive and when. Each row is one mail: a trigger, a time, a subject and a template. Subjects may contain placeholders such as {{ checklist }}."
msgstr "Welche Mails Abonnenten wann bekommen. Jede Zeile ist eine Mail: ein Auslöser, eine Uhrzeit, ein Betreff und eine Vorlage. Betreffzeilen dürfen Platzhalter wie {{ checklist }} enthalten."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:346
msgid "Subject of the confirmation mail"
msgstr "Betreff der Bestätigungsmail"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:347
msgid "The mail with the confirmation link (template confirm.html). Empty: the default subject."
msgstr "Die Mail mit dem Bestätigungslink (Vorlage confirm.html). Leer: der Standardbetreff."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:350 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:187
msgid "Please confirm your subscription: {{ checklist }}"
msgstr "Bitte bestätige dein Abo: {{ checklist }}"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:355
msgid "Sending rules"
msgstr "Versandregeln"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:362 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:837
msgid "Send log"
msgstr "Versandprotokoll"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:366
msgid "Keep a send log"
msgstr "Versandprotokoll führen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:367
msgid "Records time, masked recipient (e.g. jo***@ex***.de), subject and success of every mail — never the full address or the content. Off by default."
msgstr "Hält Zeit, maskierten Empfänger (z. B. jo***@ex***.de), Betreff und Erfolg jeder Mail fest – nie die vollständige Adresse oder den Inhalt. Standardmäßig aus."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:374
msgid "Keep log entries for"
msgstr "Protokolleinträge behalten für"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:375
msgid "Days."
msgstr "Tage."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:397
msgid "Available building blocks"
msgstr "Verfügbare Bausteine"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:409
msgid "Always available, as every checklist is built on it."
msgstr "Immer verfügbar, weil jede Checkliste darauf aufbaut."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:421
msgid "Colour scale"
msgstr "Farbskala"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:422
msgid "Five steps from lowest to highest. A scale with three colours uses the first, the middle and the last step."
msgstr "Fünf Stufen von der niedrigsten zur höchsten. Eine Skala mit drei Farben verwendet die erste, die mittlere und die letzte Stufe."

#. translators: %s: step number.
#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:433
#, php-format
msgid "Step %s"
msgstr "Stufe %s"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:448 includes/lib/blocks/class-checkoff-block-number-scale.php:36
msgid "Rating with numbers"
msgstr "Bewertung mit Zahlen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:453
msgid "Default from"
msgstr "Standard von"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:454
msgid "Lowest number of a new rating block. Visitors can change it per block."
msgstr "Niedrigste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins. Besucher können sie je Baustein ändern."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:464
msgid "Default to"
msgstr "Standard bis"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:465
msgid "Highest number of a new rating block."
msgstr "Höchste Zahl eines neuen Bewertungsbausteins."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:528 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:714
msgid "CheckOff Settings"
msgstr "CheckOff-Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:529 includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:567 includes/class-checkoff.php:327
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:738
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:764
msgid "Everything on one page: the checklist when the address carries an ID, otherwise the forms to create and open one and the recently opened checklists."
msgstr "Alles auf einer Seite: die Checkliste, wenn die Adresse eine ID enthält, sonst die Formulare zum Anlegen und Öffnen und die zuletzt geöffneten Checklisten."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:765
msgid "The checklist whose ID is in the address (?cko=…)."
msgstr "Die Checkliste, deren ID in der Adresse steht (?cko=…)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:766
msgid "A fixed checklist, e.g. embedded by the theme."
msgstr "Eine feste Checkliste, z. B. vom Theme eingebunden."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:767
msgid "Form to create a checklist. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Formular zum Anlegen einer Checkliste. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:768
msgid "Form to open a checklist by its ID. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Formular zum Öffnen einer Checkliste per ID. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:769
msgid "The templates of this site as cards, each with a button to start from it. Attributes: title, button."
msgstr "Die Vorlagen dieser Website als Karten, jede mit einem Knopf, um damit zu beginnen. Attribute: title, button."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:770
msgid "Checklists recently opened on this device. Attribute: title."
msgstr "Auf diesem Gerät zuletzt geöffnete Checklisten. Attribut: title."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:773
msgid "Shortcodes"
msgstr "Shortcodes"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:793
msgid "Title of the checklist."
msgstr "Titel der Checkliste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:794
msgid "Link to the checklist (contains its ID)."
msgstr "Link zur Checkliste (enthält ihre ID)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:795
msgid "The ID of the checklist."
msgstr "Die ID der Checkliste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:796
msgid "The repetition in words, e.g. \"Weekly, 6 times\"."
msgstr "Die Wiederholung in Worten, z. B. „Wöchentlich, 6-mal“."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:797
msgid "The current round, e.g. \"Round 3 of 6\" (empty if the checklist does not repeat)."
msgstr "Der aktuelle Durchgang, z. B. „Durchgang 3 von 6“ (leer, wenn sich die Checkliste nicht wiederholt)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:798
msgid "First and last day of the current round."
msgstr "Erster und letzter Tag des aktuellen Durchgangs."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:799
#, php-format
msgid "E.g. \"Round 3 of 6: 4 of 10 done (40 %)\"."
msgstr "Z. B. „Durchgang 3 von 6: 4 von 10 erledigt (40 %)“."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:800
msgid "Progress of the current round as numbers."
msgstr "Fortschritt des aktuellen Durchgangs als Zahlen."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:801
msgid "Number of open entries."
msgstr "Anzahl offener Einträge."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:802
msgid "The open entries as a list."
msgstr "Die offenen Einträge als Liste."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:803
msgid "The whole checklist with the state of every entry."
msgstr "Die ganze Checkliste mit dem Stand jedes Eintrags."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:804
#, php-format
msgid "How the previous round went, e.g. \"Round 2: 8 of 10 done (80 %).\" (empty in the first round)."
msgstr "Wie der vorige Durchgang lief, z. B. „Durchgang 2: 8 von 10 erledigt (80 %).“ (im ersten Durchgang leer)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:805
msgid "What stayed open in the previous round."
msgstr "Was im vorigen Durchgang offen blieb."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:806
msgid "Unsubscribe link (the layout already shows one)."
msgstr "Abmeldelink (das Layout zeigt bereits einen)."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:807
msgid "The site."
msgstr "Die Website."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:808
msgid "Only in confirm.html: the confirmation link and the hours until an unconfirmed subscription is deleted."
msgstr "Nur in confirm.html: der Bestätigungslink und die Stunden, bis ein unbestätigtes Abo gelöscht wird."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:811
msgid "Templates and placeholders"
msgstr "Vorlagen und Platzhalter"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:812
msgid "Templates are HTML files. To change one, copy it from the plugin folder templates/emails/ to <your theme>/checkoff/emails/ and edit the copy; files in the theme always win. A subfolder named after the site language (e.g. de_DE/) is used first. layout.html is the frame around every mail, confirm.html the confirmation mail; every other file can be chosen in a sending rule."
msgstr "Vorlagen sind HTML-Dateien. Um eine zu ändern, kopiere sie aus dem Plugin-Ordner templates/emails/ nach <dein Theme>/checkoff/emails/ und bearbeite die Kopie; Dateien im Theme haben immer Vorrang. Ein Unterordner mit dem Namen der Website-Sprache (z. B. de_DE/) wird zuerst verwendet. layout.html ist der Rahmen um jede Mail, confirm.html die Bestätigungsmail; jede andere Datei lässt sich in einer Versandregel auswählen."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:840
msgid "No mails sent yet."
msgstr "Noch keine Mails verschickt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:844 includes/lib/class-checkoff-admin-api.php:191
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Zeit"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:845
msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Empfänger"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:846 includes/lib/class-checkoff-admin-api.php:192
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Betreff"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:847 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:1374
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:855
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Verschickt"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:855
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Fehlgeschlagen"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:860
msgid "Clear log"
msgstr "Protokoll leeren"

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:879
msgid "Cloning of Checkoff_Settings is forbidden."
msgstr "Das Klonen von Checkoff_Settings ist nicht erlaubt."

#: includes/class-checkoff-settings.php:886
msgid "Unserializing instances of Checkoff_Settings is forbidden."
msgstr "Das Deserialisieren von Checkoff_Settings ist nicht erlaubt."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:311
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Bearbeiten"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:312
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Fertig"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:313
msgid "Add item"
msgstr "Eintrag hinzufügen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:314
msgid "Add sub-list"
msgstr "Unterliste hinzufügen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:315
msgid "Add building block"
msgstr "Baustein hinzufügen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:316
msgid "Heading (optional)"
msgstr "Überschrift (optional)"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:317
msgid "This checklist is still empty."
msgstr "Diese Checkliste ist noch leer."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:318
msgid "No building blocks yet. Add one below."
msgstr "Noch keine Bausteine. Füge unten einen hinzu."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:319
msgid "What needs to be done?"
msgstr "Was ist zu tun?"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:320
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:321
msgid "Description (optional)"
msgstr "Beschreibung (optional)"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:322
msgid "Choose a building block"
msgstr "Baustein auswählen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:323
msgid "Move up"
msgstr "Nach oben"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:324
msgid "Move down"
msgstr "Nach unten"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:325
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Duplizieren"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:326 includes/lib/class-checkoff-subscriptions.php:1426
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:328
msgid "Collapse"
msgstr "Einklappen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:329
msgid "Expand"
msgstr "Ausklappen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:330
msgid "Delete this entry?"
msgstr "Diesen Eintrag löschen?"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:331
msgid "Delete this sub-list with everything in it?"
msgstr "Diese Unterliste mit ihrem gesamten Inhalt löschen?"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:332
msgid "Delete the whole checklist? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Die ganze Checkliste löschen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:333
msgid "Clear all ticks and ratings of this checklist?"
msgstr "Alle Haken und Bewertungen dieser Checkliste entfernen?"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:334
msgid "Delete checklist"
msgstr "Checkliste löschen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:335
msgid "Clear all ticks"
msgstr "Alle Haken entfernen"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:336
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Speichern …"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:337
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Gespeichert"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:338
msgid "Could not be saved. Please try again."
msgstr "Konnte nicht gespeichert werden. Bitte versuche es noch einmal."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:339
msgid "This checklist was changed somewhere else. Reload the page to see the latest version."
msgstr "Diese Checkliste wurde an anderer Stelle geändert. Lade die Seite neu, um den aktuellen Stand zu sehen."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:340
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Neu laden"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:341
msgid "Sub-lists cannot be nested any deeper."
msgstr "Unterlisten können nicht tiefer verschachtelt werden."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:342
msgid "This checklist has reached its maximum size."
msgstr "Diese Checkliste hat ihre maximale Größe erreicht."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:343
msgid "Nothing here yet."
msgstr "Hier ist noch nichts."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:344
msgid "Nothing here yet. Add an item or a sub-list."
msgstr "Hier ist noch nichts. Füge einen Eintrag oder eine Unterliste hinzu."

#. translators: 1: number of completed entries, 2: number of entries.
#: includes/class-checkoff.php:346
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s von %2$s"

#. translators: 1: number of completed entries, 2: number of entries.
#: includes/class-checkoff.php:347 includes/lib/class-checkoff-post-meta.php:41 includes/lib/class-checkoff-post-types.php:101 includes/lib/class-checkoff-shortcodes.php:310
msgid "Checklist ID"
msgstr "Checklisten-ID"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:348
msgid "Keep this ID: it is the only way to find this checklist again."
msgstr "Bewahre diese ID gut auf: Nur mit ihr findest du diese Checkliste wieder."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:349
msgid "Copy ID"
msgstr "ID kopieren"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:350
msgid "Copy link"
msgstr "Link kopieren"

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:351 includes/class-checkoff.php:454
msgid "Copied."
msgstr "Kopiert."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:352 includes/class-checkoff.php:455
msgid "Copying failed. Please copy it by hand."
msgstr "Kopieren fehlgeschlagen. Bitte kopiere es von Hand."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:353
msgid "Your checklist has been created."
msgstr "Deine Checkliste wurde angelegt."

#: includes/class-checkoff.php:354
msgid "The checklist could not be created."
